# Tests only when requested

- **Do not** create new test files, new test cases, or expand existing specs **unless the user clearly asks** for tests (e.g. “add a Playwright test”, “cover this with tests”).
- **Do not** proactively add tests as part of feature work, refactors, or documentation updates when the user did not request them.
- If test coverage would help, **mention it briefly** after the task and let the user decide—do not implement tests without a direct request.

This applies to `tests/ui-tests/`, `*.spec.ts`, `*.test.ts`, and backend test folders.
